.TH TEXT_LINE_HEIGHT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
text_line_height \- Height of one line in font f, for stacking lines: y += text_line_height(f)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtext.h\(dq
.BI "float text_line_height(Font f);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Height of one line in font f, for stacking lines: y += text_line_height(f). 8 for the debug font.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the line height in logical pixels.
.SH MODULE
text (src/engine/text/text.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR text_size (3),
.BR text_draw (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
